===========================================================================
3. FONTS NAMED BUT NOT REDISTRIBUTED
===========================================================================

Two theme presets can ask the platform's text stack for a proprietary system
face by name. Neither font is included in this repository or in any binary
built from it, and no licence to either is granted or implied. The face
resolves only on a machine that already has it installed; on any other, the
text stack falls back to the bundled Inter and JetBrains Mono.

    Segoe UI Variable, Consolas    Microsoft Corporation
                                   teksilo-theme-fluent, "system-fonts"

    SF Pro Text, SF Mono           Apple Inc.
                                   teksilo-theme-macos, "system-fonts"

The same applies to the platform colour-emoji faces (Noto Color Emoji, Apple
Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji) that the teksilo-text "system-emoji" feature
reads from well-known paths at startup: located at runtime, never embedded.


===========================================================================
4. CARGO DEPENDENCIES
===========================================================================

This file covers material vendored into the Teksilo source tree. Teksilo's
Cargo dependencies are not vendored here; each carries its own licence,
resolvable from Cargo.lock. A binary you build and ship links them, so its
own notice file needs to account for them -- `cargo about` or `cargo deny`
will generate that list.
